MODIFICATIONS

NeBeso has made substantial modifications to the original TokenBudget codebase,
including but not limited to:

- Organization/group management with business_name support
- Mobile-responsive layout (Header, Sidebar, PageShell)
- Admin pages (AdminGroups, AdminGroupDetail, AdminUsers, AdminContacts, AdminSystem)
- Budget, alert, and analytics features
- Clerk authentication integration
- Proxy infrastructure and OTLP observability
- Pricing engine and price monitoring
- RBAC and project member management
- New SDK (Python and JavaScript/TypeScript)
- Complete UI redesign (NeBeso brand, colors, typography)

All new code and modifications are Copyright 2026 NeBeso and are NOT licensed
under Apache 2.0 unless explicitly stated. See individual file headers.

The open-source Layer 1 components (generic UI, base models, config) remain
available under Apache 2.0 in the nebeso-core repository.
